#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s now reports %(amount)s paid online, less than the %(registered)s"
" registered automatically. Refunds are not registered automatically: review "
"the payments."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica ahora %(amount)s pagados online, menos que los "
"%(registered)s registrados automáticamente. Las devoluciones no se registran "
"automáticamente: revisa los pagos."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s reports %(amount)s paid online for the whole booking, already "
"registered on another folio of the same booking (%(folios)s). It has not "
"been registered again."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica %(amount)s pagados online para toda la reserva, ya "
"registrados en otra ficha de la misma reserva (%(folios)s). No se ha vuelto "
"a registrar."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s reports %(amount)s paid online for the whole booking, which "
"Wubook split in %(parts)s folios. It has not been registered automatically: "
"register it by hand on the right folio."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica %(amount)s pagados online para toda la reserva, que "
"Wubook dividió en %(parts)s fichas. No se ha registrado automáticamente: "
"regístralo a mano en la ficha que corresponda."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s reports %(amount)s paid online, but the folio is in "
"%(folio_currency)s. It has not been registered automatically."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica %(amount)s pagados online, pero la ficha está en "
"%(folio_currency)s. No se ha registrado automáticamente."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s reports %(amount)s paid online. The folio already has payments "
"registered by hand, so it has not been registered automatically to avoid a "
"duplicate."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica %(amount)s pagados online. La ficha ya tiene pagos "
"registrados a mano, así que no se ha registrado automáticamente para no "
"duplicarlo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s reports %(paid)s paid online: payment of %(amount)s registered "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s comunica %(paid)s pagados online: pago de %(amount)s registrado "
"automáticamente."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(channel)s: online payment pending until %(deadline)s. If the guest does "
"not pay, the channel will cancel the booking."
msgstr ""
"%(channel)s: pago online pendiente hasta el %(deadline)s. Si el huésped no "
"paga, el canal cancelará la reserva."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_amount
msgid ""
"Amount the channel reports as paid online for the whole booking (last known "
"value)."
msgstr ""
"Importe que el canal comunica como pagado online para toda la reserva "
"(último valor conocido)."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_due_amount
msgid ""
"Amount the channel reports as still due for the whole booking (last known "
"value)."
msgstr ""
"Importe que el canal comunica como pendiente de pago para toda la reserva "
"(último valor conocido)."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Booking cancelled in %(channel)s with %(amount)s paid online. The folio is "
"cancelled, so the payment has not been registered automatically: review the "
"cancellation penalty and the refund."
msgstr ""
"Reserva cancelada en %(channel)s con %(amount)s pagados online. La ficha "
"está cancelada, así que el pago no se ha registrado automáticamente: revisa "
"la penalización por cancelación y la devolución."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Booking cancelled in %(channel)s with %(amount)s paid online. The payment "
"registered automatically is kept and no refund has been registered: review "
"the cancellation penalty and the refund."
msgstr ""
"Reserva cancelada en %(channel)s con %(amount)s pagados online. Se mantiene "
"el pago registrado automáticamente y no se ha registrado ninguna devolución: "
"revisa la penalización por cancelación y la devolución."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_currency
msgid "Channel Payment Currency"
msgstr "Moneda del pago en el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_deadline
msgid "Channel Payment Deadline"
msgstr "Plazo de pago en el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_notes
msgid "Channel Payment Notes"
msgstr "Notas de pagos del canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_split
msgid "Channel Payment Split"
msgstr "Parte de la reserva dividida"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_ids
msgid "Channel Payments"
msgstr "Pagos del canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_currency
msgid "Currency (ISO code) of the amounts reported by the channel."
msgstr "Moneda (código ISO) de los importes que comunica el canal."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_deadline
msgid ""
"Deadline the channel gave the guest to pay the booking online. It is emptied"
" when the channel reports the payment."
msgstr ""
"Plazo que el canal dio al huésped para pagar la reserva online. Se vacía "
"cuando el canal comunica el pago."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_due_amount
msgid "Due at Channel"
msgstr "Pendiente según el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/common/wubook_backend_journal_ota.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Only one payment mapping per OTA can register the channel payments: %(ota)s "
"already has one."
msgstr ""
"Solo una asignación de pagos por OTA puede registrar los pagos del canal: "
"%(ota)s ya tiene una."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_amount
msgid "Paid at Channel"
msgstr "Pagado en el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_split
msgid ""
"Part of the channel booking held by this folio (part/total) when Wubook "
"split the booking in several folios."
msgstr ""
"Parte de la reserva del canal que contiene esta ficha (parte/total) cuando "
"Wubook dividió la reserva en varias fichas."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_ids
msgid ""
"Payments registered automatically from what the channel reports as paid "
"online."
msgstr ""
"Pagos registrados automáticamente a partir de lo que el canal comunica como "
"pagado online."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_wubook_backend_journal_ota__register_channel_payments
msgid "Register Channel Payments"
msgstr "Registrar pagos del canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_wubook_backend_journal_ota__register_channel_payments
msgid ""
"Register automatically, on this journal, the amount the channel reports as "
"paid online."
msgstr ""
"Registrar automáticamente, en este diario, el importe que el canal comunica "
"como pagado online."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_registered
msgid "Registered from Channel"
msgstr "Registrado desde el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_notes
msgid ""
"Technical field: last value of every kind of channel payment note posted on "
"the folio, so that re-imports do not repeat them."
msgstr ""
"Campo técnico: último valor de cada tipo de nota de pagos del canal "
"publicada en la ficha, para que las reimportaciones no las repitan."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The amount %(channel)s reports as paid online could not be registered "
"automatically (%(error)s). Review the payments of the folio."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido registrar automáticamente el importe que %(channel)s "
"comunica como pagado online (%(error)s). Revisa los pagos de la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The amount paid online (%(amount)s) exceeds the folio total (%(total)s): it "
"probably includes extras that are not in the folio."
msgstr ""
"El importe pagado online (%(amount)s) supera el total de la ficha "
"(%(total)s): probablemente incluye extras que no están en la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/common/wubook_backend_journal_ota.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To register channel payments, the OTA payment mapping needs an OTA and an "
"incoming payment method."
msgstr ""
"Para registrar los pagos del canal, la asignación de pagos de la OTA "
"necesita una OTA y un método de pago entrante."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_registered
msgid ""
"Total amount registered automatically on this folio from what the channel "
"reports as paid online. It never decreases, so payments cancelled or edited "
"by the staff are never registered again."
msgstr ""
"Importe total registrado automáticamente en esta ficha a partir de lo que el "
"canal comunica como pagado online. Nunca disminuye, así que los pagos que el "
"personal cancela o modifica no se vuelven a registrar."
